## **8. SHELL SCRIPTING**

### Basic Script Structure
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Comments
variable="value"
echo "Hello $variable"

if [ condition ]; then
    commands
elif [ condition ]; then
    commands
else
    commands
fi

for i in {1..10}; do
    echo $i
done

while read line; do
    echo $line
done < file

